Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Scheme name: Cerulean Signal Dark
; Scheme system: base24
; Scheme description: Low-glare cerulean interface theme with restrained neon-pink signal accents; dark compatibility palette.
; Scheme author: Aaron Colichia (https://aaron.colichia.org/)
; Template author: Tinted Theming (https://github.com/tinted-theming)
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\SimonTatham\PuTTY\Sessions\base24-cerulean-signal-dark]

; Default Foreground
